WEBVTT

00:10:29.757 --> 00:10:32.082
the officer ate last,

00:10:32.082 --> 00:10:35.258
and he let his men eat first,

00:10:35.258 --> 00:10:37.110
and when they were done,

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:41.200
there was no food left for him.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.933
And when they went back out in the field,

00:10:43.933 --> 00:10:46.877
his men brought him some of their food

00:10:46.877 --> 00:10:48.734
so that he may eat,

00:10:48.734 --> 00:10:50.873
because that's what happens.

00:10:50.873 --> 00:10:53.562
We call them leaders because they go first.

00:10:53.562 --> 00:10:55.305
We call them leaders because they take the risk

00:10:55.305 --> 00:10:56.960
before anybody else does.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.990
We call them leaders because they will choose

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:00.999
to sacrifice so that their people